---
import '../../styles/diagramas.css';

const tituloId = 'diag-omnirpg-titulo';
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img" aria-labelledby={tituloId} class="diagrama">
  <title id={tituloId}>
    El servidor Python guarda el estado del mundo. Los clientes de Godot solo reaccionan a
    lo que el servidor dicta, y Gemini escribe la narrativa a partir de ese mismo estado.
  </title>

  <defs>
    <marker
      id="punta-omnirpg"
      viewBox="0 0 10 10"
      refX="9"
      refY="5"
      markerWidth="6"
      markerHeight="6"
      orient="auto"
    >
      <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10Z" class="diag-punta" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <path d="M180 78 236 158" class="diag-flecha" marker-end="url(#punta-omnirpg)" />
  <path d="M180 288 236 206" class="diag-flecha" marker-end="url(#punta-omnirpg)" />
  <path d="M400 180h56" class="diag-flecha" marker-end="url(#punta-omnirpg)" />

  <rect x="240" y="140" width="160" height="80" rx="10" class="diag-nodo-acento" />
  <text x="320" y="174" class="diag-et">servidor Python</text>
  <text x="320" y="196" class="diag-et-menor">única verdad</text>

  <rect x="40" y="40" width="140" height="64" rx="10" class="diag-nodo" />
  <text x="110" y="78" class="diag-et">cliente Godot</text>

  <rect x="40" y="256" width="140" height="64" rx="10" class="diag-nodo" />
  <text x="110" y="294" class="diag-et">cliente Godot</text>

  <rect x="460" y="148" width="140" height="64" rx="10" class="diag-nodo-voz" />
  <text x="530" y="186" class="diag-et">Gemini</text>
  <text x="530" y="234" class="diag-et-menor">la voz, no la verdad</text>

  <text x="110" y="130" class="diag-et-menor">avanza solo</text>
  <text x="110" y="248" class="diag-et-menor">avanza solo</text>
</svg>
